+// A hands-on aid (start-coop-demo.sh, profile demo_quest = 1 with place_giver):
+// 5 s after both actors stand in front of Sidorovich, the party accepts his
+// "Mobbing the Mob" (esc_m_trader_task_3) as a talk would (the installed
+// accept phrases in participant 1's context, take_quest's path), and the
